# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# research-notebook — ignore rules
#
# Belt and braces. Everything that must never reach this repository is already
# refused by tools/promote.py and by .githooks/pre-commit; these lines are the
# third independent layer (RD02), and the one that catches a file added by
# hand rather than through the promotion path.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- the copyright boundary ------------------------------------------------
# No PDF, ever, anywhere, in any letter case.
#
# Two things changed after an adversarial audit of this boundary. The pattern
# is case-insensitive because `*.pdf` on a Linux runner let `paper.PDF` walk
# straight through. And the old negation for assets/figures/ is gone: a
# publisher PDF renamed into that directory beside an empty .source.yml passed
# every layer. Figures here are .svg or .png; a PDF figure is not a thing this
# repository has, so the exemption bought nothing and cost the boundary.
*.[pP][dD][fF]

# ---- private material that must never cross ---------------------------------
**/private/
*-draft.md
*.local.md
.leakwords
rw.local.json

# ---- datasets and weights ---------------------------------------------------
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.npz
*.parquet
*.dcm
*.nii
*.nii.gz
data/
runs/
checkpoints/
wandb/

# ---- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- site build -------------------------------------------------------------
site/
.cache/
.lycheecache

# ---- OS and editor ----------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
